  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE3_TITLE_1
    value: Surprise Feature!
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE3_DESCRIPTION_1
    value: 'On any spin, one of the features may be triggered:

      1. Fill a random cell or two

      2. Add extra

      3. Increase Bingo Ticket Prize

      4. Add +1 point to your Bonus Progression

      5. Turn a cell into Instant Win

      6. Lucky Stars Bonus

      7. Add         that spreads collectibles if matches with bingo ball'
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE3_TITLE_2
    value: Special Ticket Jackpots
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE3_DESCRIPTION_2
    value: 'Play Special Ticket and collect

      to win Jackpots'
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE3_TITLE_3
    value: Free Games
  - key: PAYTABLE_PAGE3_DESCRIPTION_3
    value: '3 Scatters on reels 2,3 and 4 triggers Free Games and pay x2 total bet.

      Random Wild Reels may occur on any spin.

      No ticket can be won during Free Games.'
